1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,151
₹500 mahina.

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:03,027
Kya sach mein crorepati

3
00:00:03,047 --> 00:00:04,513
bana sakta hai?

4
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:05,308
Short answer:

5
00:00:05,328 --> 00:00:05,627
haan.

6
00:00:05,647 --> 00:00:07,498
Par time bahut lagta hai.

7
00:00:07,518 --> 00:00:09,244
12% per year maano,

8
00:00:09,264 --> 00:00:11,544
toh 10 saal baad kareeb

9
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:12,697
₹1.16 lakh.

10
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:13,858
30 saal baad,

11
00:00:13,878 --> 00:00:15,516
kareeb ₹17.6 lakh.

12
00:00:15,536 --> 00:00:16,502
Aur ₹1 crore?

13
00:00:16,522 --> 00:00:18,754
Uske liye kareeb 45 saal.

14
00:00:18,774 --> 00:00:20,454
Zyaadatar paisa aakhri 10

15
00:00:20,474 --> 00:00:21,870
saalon mein aata hai.

16
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,510
Yahi hai compounding.

17
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:25,515
Ab ek habit add karo:

18
00:00:25,535 --> 00:00:28,418
har saal apna SIP 10% badhao.

19
00:00:28,438 --> 00:00:29,506
Same shuruaat,

20
00:00:29,526 --> 00:00:30,254
same ₹500.

21
00:00:30,274 --> 00:00:32,157
₹1 crore kareeb 36 saal

22
00:00:32,177 --> 00:00:32,845
mein.

23
00:00:32,865 --> 00:00:34,732
Yeh 12% per year maan kar

24
00:00:34,752 --> 00:00:35,036
hai.

25
00:00:35,056 --> 00:00:36,801
Real returns upar neeche

26
00:00:36,821 --> 00:00:37,531
hote hain,

27
00:00:37,551 --> 00:00:39,150
koi guarantee nahi.

28
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:40,787
Toh ₹500 se shuru karo.

29
00:00:40,807 --> 00:00:42,582
Bas ₹500 pe ruko mat.

30
00:00:42,602 --> 00:00:45,469
Follow karo The 7% Club.
